  {
    "id": "20261122-150011",
    "rubric": "Donalik va kichik buyurtmalar",
    "title": "Taobao: Sharf tarkibida qancha jun bor?",
    "text": "🧣 <b>TAOBAO: SHARFDA QANCHA JUN BOR?</b>\n\nO‘zingizga yoki sovg‘aga sharf tanlayapsizmi? Mahsulot nomidagi “jun” so‘zi bilan cheklanmay, tarkibini tekshiring.\n\n<b>Immensus Post tavsiyasi:</b>\n1️⃣ Mahsulot sahifasida tarkib yorlig‘i rasmini oching.\n2️⃣ Yorliqdan jun va akril miqdorini ko‘ring.\n3️⃣ Yorliq ko‘rinmasa, sotuvchidan uning suratini so‘rang.\n\nMasalan, junli sharf izlayotgan bo‘lsangiz, to‘lovdan oldin yorliqdagi jun miqdorini o‘zingiz xohlagan tarkib bilan solishtiring.\n\nSharf haqida: <a href=\"https://scjgj.beijing.gov.cn/zwxx/scjgdt/202610/t20261004_4890262.html\">Manba</a>\n\nO‘yinchoq tanlash bo‘yicha: <a href=\"https://www.samr.gov.cn/xw/sj/art/2026/art_f505c48ef72a4883be8e06d240613525.html\">Manba</a>, <a href=\"https://scjgj.beijing.gov.cn/zwxx/scjgdt/202607/t20260717_4767743.html\">Manba</a>.\n\n📌 Foydali bo'lsa, postni saqlab qo'ying va yaqinlaringizga ulashing. 🔔 Xitoy platformalari bo'yicha sodda qo'llanmalar — @immensuspost\n\n#ImmensusPost #XitoydanBuyurtma #FoydaliMaslahat",
    "kind": "photo",
    "file_id": "AgACAgUAAxkDAAIBimsDA_8bW2y42Jfy_5Xcf_YrBpzlAAIjFmsbKvoZVFHnVowf3hmkAQADAgADeQADPQQ",
    "media_path": "/home/runner/work/immensus-post/immensus-post/.work/20261122-150011/image.png",
    "topic": {
      "title": "Taobao: Sharf tarkibida qancha jun bor?",
      "angle": "3 qadamli tekshiruv ro‘yxati: tarkib yorlig‘ini ochish, jun va akril miqdorini ko‘rish, yorliq ko‘rinmasa sotuvchidan suratini so‘rash.",
      "why_now": "Sovuq mavsumda sharf kundalik xarid yoki sovg‘a uchun kerak bo‘lishi mumkin.",
      "research": "Quyidagi mavzular 2026-yil 22-noyabr holatiga tanlandi. Platformalar xarid uchun misol sifatida ko‘rsatilgan; ularning alohida funksiyalari yoki qoidalari haqida tasdiqlanmagan da’vo yo‘q. Rasmiy manbalar Xitoy bozoridagi mahsulot tanlash maslahatlariga tegishli.\n\n1. **Taobao: Sharfning tarkibida nima bor?**\n   - **Burchak:** «Jun» degan nomning o‘zi bilan cheklanmay, tarkib yorlig‘ini ochish; jun va akril miqdorini ko‘rish. Yorliq ko‘rinmasa, sotuvchidan rasmini so‘rash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Sovuq mavsumda sharf kundalik xarid yoki sovg‘a uchun kerak bo‘lishi mumkin.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([scjgj.beijing.gov.cn](https://scjgj.beijing.gov.cn/zwxx/scjgdt/202610/t20261004_4890262.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n2. **Pinduoduo: Yuz artish salfetkasi paxtalimi?**\n   - **Burchak:** «O‘simlik tolasi» degan umumiy yozuv o‘rniga tarkibdan paxta yoki viskozani izlash; tarkib noaniq bo‘lsa, sotuvchidan aniqlashtirish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Bu kundalik tugab turadigan, kichik savatga qo‘shiladigan mahsulot.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([scjgj.beijing.gov.cn](https://scjgj.beijing.gov.cn/zwxx/scjgdt/202607/t20260715_4763579.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n3. **Taobao: Maktab sumkasining tasmasi qayerga tikilgan?**\n   - **Burchak:** Rasmlarda tasma va sumka birikkan joyni yaqinlashtirib ko‘rish; chok ko‘rinmasa, sotuvchidan yaqin surat so‘rash. Rasmdan mustahkamlikni to‘liq bilib bo‘lmasligini eslatish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Maktab davomida eskirgan sumkani almashtirishda qo‘l keladi.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([scjgj.xinjiang.gov.cn](https://scjgj.xinjiang.gov.cn/xjaic/tzgg/202603/2a562fc4a9b3414e8c1f450690b60db2.shtml?utm_source=openai))\n\n4. **Pinduoduo: Yumshoq o‘yinchoqni yuvish mumkinmi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Mahsulot tavsifi yoki yorlig‘idan yuvish ko‘rsatmasini izlash; topilmasa, sotuvchidan so‘rash va noaniq javob bo‘lsa boshqa variantni ko‘rish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Sovg‘a sifatida olinadigan o‘yinchoqni keyinchalik tozalash qulayligini xariddan oldin bilish foydali.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([samr.gov.cn](https://www.samr.gov.cn/xw/sj/art/2026/art_f505c48ef72a4883be8e06d240613525.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n5. **Tmall: Yumshoq o‘yinchoqning choki ko‘rinadimi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Suratlarda chok joylarini ko‘rish, yaqin surat so‘rash; o‘yinchoq kelgach, chok ochilmaganini tekshirish. Suratning o‘zi xavfsizlikni kafolatlamaydi.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Bolaga o‘yinchoq tanlashda ichidagi to‘ldirma chiqib ketmasligiga e’tibor berish har mavsumda muhim.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([scjgj.beijing.gov.cn](https://scjgj.beijing.gov.cn/zwxx/scjgdt/202607/t20260717_4767743.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n6. **Taobao: Sochiq tarkibida paxta bormi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Mahsulot nomiga emas, tarkib yorlig‘iga qarash; paxta kerak bo‘lsa, uning miqdorini tekshirish.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Sochiq uy uchun ham, kichik sovg‘a uchun ham amaliy tanlov.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([amr.jinan.gov.cn](https://amr.jinan.gov.cn/cms_files/complat3/48725/attach/20261/455f098c5b1e403db9ac665b0a7597e0.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n\n7. **Tmall: Termos qopqog‘ini tozalash osonmi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Qopqoq qismlari ajralishi va yuvilishi haqida tavsifni ko‘rish; ma’lumot yo‘q bo‘lsa, sotuvchidan so‘rash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Sovuq mavsumda issiq ichimlik olib yurish uchun termos tanlayotganlarga foydali.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([scjgj.gz.gov.cn](https://scjgj.gz.gov.cn/zmhd/cjwt/kpxc/content/post_8903751.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n8. **Taobao: Yostiq jildining matosi nimadan?**\n   - **Burchak:** Suratdagi ko‘rinishga tayanmay, mato tarkibi yozilgan yorliqni qidirish; ma’lumot bo‘lmasa, sotuvchidan yorliq rasmini so‘rash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Yotoq buyumlarini yangilashda bitta jildning o‘zini ham ehtiyojga qarab tanlash mumkin.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([scjgj.sh.gov.cn](https://scjgj.sh.gov.cn/1072/20220720/2c984ad68215fb720182194357db0985.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Foydalanilgan rasmiy manbalar:**\n\n- Xitoy bozor nazorati boshqarmasi — bolalar o‘yinchog‘ini tanlash bo‘yicha maslaha",
